        },
        "q8": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "What comes with it?",
            "a": "The bike, its charger, the wireless key and your steel owner card. At checkout you can add a spare wireless key, and you can choose the configuration that includes a ten-year replacement term."
          }
        },
        "q9": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "What is 10-Year Replacement?",
            "a": "A second configuration of the bike rather than an add-on. Choose it at checkout and for ten years from delivery we replace the whole machine rather than repair it. Full terms are on the refund and terms pages. It is not insurance and is not underwritten by an insurer; it is an extended replacement term offered by us directly."
          }
        },
        "q10": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "When does it ship?",
            "a": "Four to six weeks from order. Your key case arrives days before the bike does, and you can cancel for a full refund any time before dispatch."
